# TITAN V4 checker donor hardening patch H4 — dict/reflection provenance precision
#
# Apply AFTER H3 b1dd199ce69d2f3b7dc441769442a218c495a76d.
# H4 repairs deterministic false-greens found by exact H3 source audit:
#   1) dict literal constant lookup must obey Python last-equal-key wins;
#   2) dynamic keys / ** mappings that may override a constant lookup must fail
#      conservatively rather than letting an earlier safe entry certify safety;
#   3) globals()/locals().get(PROTECTED, default) is a protected class lookup.
# Donor only. No checker carrier/ref/workflow/Actions/canonical authority.

